fin-orders:ExternalOrderStatusMapping a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "An External Order Status Mapping is a reviewed, effective-dated mapping, used for translating one provider raw status code into exactly one canonical lifecycle state, and for preventing provider values from entering the canonical vocabulary.";
