fin-post-trade:CorporateActionOption a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "The corporate action option is an optional selectable outcome of a voluntary or default corporate action event, carrying the option kind (default, voluntary election, withdrawal, amendment, or partial allocation), the consideration, the election deadline, and the allocation ratio. It generalizes the single-choice rule of the Direct Rights Due-Bill Corporate Action Profile into a multi-option lifecycle per ISO 15022 MT564/565/566/567.";
    rdfs:label "Corporate Action Option";
