fin-post-trade:CorporateActionSubscriptionFulfillmentClosure a owl:Class;
    rdfs:comment "The corporate action subscription fulfillment closure is a complete PIT closure that, for one subscription obligation, closes every current fulfillment version, separately sums the cash and security results, and yields an exact unfulfilled, partial, or full outcome, used for settling the final state of both legs of a subscription obligation.";
    rdfs:label "Corporate Action Subscription Fulfillment Closure";
